# The corridor's yard from the CD block hub's lift (BOOT_AT_HUB 1 in src/input.c: stood facing
# west, 150 short of the pad). Onto the pad, a half turn to face east (as lift_pyramid.steps), and
# shots as it rises: level, a little to the right, and looking down. From above the corridor's
# walls its floor must show under the yard's boxes (the user, 2026-11-13: "there is no floor in
# the yard")
wait_up
wait 1.0
hold up 0.45
wait 0.3
hold left 0.4
wait 0.4
hold left 0.4
wait 0.4
hold left 0.4
wait 0.4
hold left 0.4
wait 1.4
shot ly_01_rising
wait 1.0
shot ly_02_rising
hold right 0.4
wait 0.4
shot ly_03_right
keydown b
wait 0.8
shot ly_04_down
keyup b
wait 0.6
hold left 0.4
wait 0.4
shot ly_05_left
keydown b
wait 0.8
shot ly_06_left_down
keyup b
wait 1.5
shot ly_07_top
